#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "sane-ricoh2 - SANE backend for Ricoh flatbed scanners"
msgstr "sane-ricoh2 - controlor SANE pentru scanerele plate Ricoh"

